---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Beginner Guide"
description: "Everything you need to go from curious to confident on a wing foil — gear, technique, safety, and where to start."
---
<section class="section-header wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow">Start Here</p>
  <h1>Beginner Guide</h1>
  <p class="section-header-lede">Eight guides covering everything you need before and during your first sessions on a wing foil.</p>
</section>

<section class="wrap">
  <div class="guide-grid">
    {% for item in collections.guide %}
    <article class="guide-card">
      <span class="num">{{ "0" if item.data.order < 10 }}{{ item.data.order }}</span>
      <h2><a class="card-link" href="{{ item.url | url }}">{{ item.data.title }}</a></h2>
      <p>{{ item.data.description }}</p>
      <a class="go" href="{{ item.url | url }}" aria-label="Read guide: {{ item.data.title }}">Read guide &rarr;</a>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
